Rice Dream, made from unmilled rice, heightens the compatibility of the metzuru and bread.

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:49.320
The refined fragrance of the traditional English tea, Quality Season, invites your appetite.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:53.990
