00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.030
Azuma Kazuma, huh?

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.540
Azuma was making a doughnut?

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:28.130
While we’re calling it a doughnut, it’s a
