00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.590
This oil is no regular oil, right?

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.560
I can tell by its fragrance.

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:19.970
Cannabis oil is mixed in it, right?!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:20.850
That’s right.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:23.050
I extracted it using an oil press this morning.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:26.020
The ignition temperature of cannabis oil is lower,

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.020
so I blended it with sesame oil.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.770
So, I got an oil that’s healthy for you.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.860
That’s pretty cool, Azuma.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.270
With this, beating Shadow is...

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.780
