00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.120
Bake, fry, and then bake again.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:26.080
Is there really going to be something special there after all this work?

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:26.870
Yes there is!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:27.450
