00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:07.450
If you lightly bake sugar,
it turns into brown caramel, right?

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.330
Uh, yeah...

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:12.750
In addition to turning sweeter,
it becomes more fragrant and delicious.

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.380
This process is called caramelization.

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:18.010
